    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: 'ARCHER


    Ranged attacker - shoots arrows over your front line.


    Cost:
    40 gold

    Health: 50

    Damage: 15

    Range: 13 (longest after the Catapult)

    Speed:
    3


    EFFECT

    Stops as soon as an enemy is inside its range and keeps shooting
    arrows at it. Each arrow damages the first enemy it touches.

    Allied melee
    units are allowed to walk through the Archer and the Archer steps back behind
    them, so it can keep firing from a safe distance.


    GOOD AGAINST: large groups
    of melee units that it can outrange.

    WEAK AGAINST: anything that reaches
    it - 50 health does not last long.'
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d5ebee651e89ca246872b816a8e066e6, type: 2}
  m_sharedMaterial: {fileID: -1952119201147414789, guid: d5ebee651e89ca246872b816a8e066e6, type: 2}
