--- !u!114 &5402442638604956301
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 4818535284658864024}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: f4688fdb7df04437aeb418b961361dc5, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  m_Material: {fileID: 0}
  m_Color: {r: 1, g: 1, b: 1, a: 1}
  m_RaycastTarget: 1
  m_RaycastPadding: {x: 0, y: 0, z: 0, w: 0}
  m_Maskable: 1
  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: '<size=32><color=#FED66D>GOAL</color></size>

    Destroy the enemy King
    - the big red slime guarding the castle on the right - before the red army destroys
    yours.


    <size=32><color=#FED66D>TOUCH CONTROLS</color></size>

    Drag
    one finger on the battlefield to pan the camera, pinch with two fingers to zoom
    in / out.

    Tap a unit button on the bottom bar to send that unit to the front
    line.

    Tap <color=#FED66D>UPGRADE</color> to level up your castle, <color=#FED66D>PAUSE</color>
    to stop the match.


    <size=32><color=#FED66D>GOLD</color></size>

    Every
    unit costs gold, and your King is the only source of it: it drops gold every
    <color=#FED66D>2-4 seconds</color>, but it stops while it is under attack, so
    never let the enemy reach it. Killing a red unit also pays you a bounty of <color=#FED66D>30%</color>
    of that unit''s price.


    <size=32><color=#FED66D>SENDING UNITS</color></size>

    You
    never control a single unit: once sent it marches forward on its own, stops at
    the first enemy in range and fights by itself.

    After each unit is sent the
    whole bar locks for <color=#FED66D>1.5 seconds</color>, and you may keep at most
    <color=#FED66D>8</color> of your own units alive at once.


    <size=32><color=#FED66D>UPGRADING
    THE CASTLE</color></size>

    Your castle can be upgraded <color=#FED66D>2 times
    (100 then 250 gold)</color>. Each level gives <color=#FED66D>+25% gold income</color>
    and <color=#FED66D>+10% health and damage</color> to every unit you send afterwards.


    <size=32><color=#FED66D>WIN
    / LOSE</color></size>

    Win by destroying the red King. Lose if your blue
    King is destroyed.


    <size=32><color=#FED66D>TIP</color></size>

    Hold
    the front line with BaseSlime, Sword or SpearMan and let Slinger, Archer and
    Catapult shoot over them. A few cheap BaseSlime in front make your expensive
    units last much longer.'
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d5ebee651e89ca246872b816a8e066e6, type: 2}
  m_sharedMaterial: {fileID: -1952119201147414789, guid: d5ebee651e89ca246872b816a8e066e6, type: 2}
